---
InheritParentConfig: true
# Tests return a future while its promise is still a local in the same frame. The future holds a back-pointer into
# that promise until ~weak_view clears it right after the return, which the analyzer doesn't follow (false positive).
# Tests mostly call capturing coroutine lambdas inline in run_until_complete(), where the closure outlives the run;
# the check flags every capturing coroutine lambda regardless, so it's off here and ASan catches the unsafe ones.
Checks:
    - '-clang-analyzer-core.StackAddressEscape'
    - '-cppcoreguidelines-avoid-capturing-lambda-coroutines'
